  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseWeapon"><defName>NMC_ArchonFocus</defName><label>执政官灵能权杖</label><description>执政官用来聚焦心灵支配力量的权杖。它只能提供有限的近战自卫能力，不适合用作主要近战武器。支援结束后由军团收回。</description><techLevel>Spacer</techLevel><tradeability>None</tradeability><generateCommonality>0</generateCommonality><smeltable>false</smeltable><burnableByRecipe>false</burnableByRecipe><thingCategories><li>WeaponsMelee</li></thingCategories><weaponClasses><li>Melee</li></weaponClasses><statBases><MaxHitPoints>150</MaxHitPoints><Mass>1</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability><MarketValue>0</MarketValue></statBases><graphicData><texPath>NMC/GhostEquipment/shadow_lance</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass></graphicData><equippedAngleOffset>-65</equippedAngleOffset><comps><li><compClass>CompQuality</compClass></li><li Class="CompProperties_Biocodable"/><li Class="NivarianCommander.CompProperties_LegionEquipment"/></comps><tools><li><label>杖柄</label><capacities><li>Blunt</li></capacities><power>4</power><cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime><armorPenetration>0</armorPenetration></li></tools></ThingDef>
  <AbilityDef><defName>NMC_SeydasControlFallback</defName><abilityClass>NivarianCommander.Ability_SeydasControlFallback</abilityClass><label>心灵支配</label><description>以心灵支配使20格内的一名敌人加入涅瓦莲幸存者派系。施法者会优先选择价值较高的目标，机械体与首领也可能受到控制。每次需要50点专注，冷却8秒。

